vāyunā calate toyaṃ kṣobhayantaṃ punaḥ punaḥ |
niścalatvaṃ na cāstīti tathā citteti durlabham || 1 ||

oṃ bhagavandevadeveśa lokanāthajagatpate |
saṅkṣepāt kāraṇaṃ brūhi yatra citte suniścalam || 2 ||

sādhu sādhu mahāprājña dṛṣṭaṃ te buddhi kauśalam |
kathayāmi na sandehaḥ putra snehādviśeṣataḥ || 3 ||

<p. 86a> trividhaṃ kāraṇaṃ proktaṃ sthūlaṃ sūkṣmaṃ paraṃ ca yat |
sthūlena rañjitā devā mahāmāyā vaśī kṛtāḥ || 4 ||

kāraṇaṃ tu pravakṣyāmi śṛṇuṣveka manāguha |
tālumadhye tu karaṇaṃ niśśvāsocchvāsavarjitam || 5 ||

nābhihṛddhāmamadhyasthaṃ kandago vandanaṃ manāk |
tālusaṃjñā bhavet tasya yato vā cāpravartinam || 6 ||

tatra sthāne kṛtā buddhiścitraṃ tatra suniścalam |
niścalaṃ tu yadā cittaṃ tadā dṛṣṭiḥ pravartate || 7 ||

sā ca dṛṣṭiḥ parājñeyā trailokyaṃ paśyate kṣaṇāt |
agamyaṃ gamyate caiva alakṣyaṃ lakṣyate tadā || 8 ||

anādanādamadhyasthā vyaktāvyaktaṃ suniścalam |
tadā pravartate nidrā yogadhyānaparāyaṇā || 9 ||

<p. 86b> ānandaṃ bhakṣayed yastu amṛtāmṛtasambhavam |
pravartate nirānandaṃ niścalasthāvavarjitam || 10 ||

niraupamyaṃ nirābhāsaṃ dhyānadhāraṇavarjitam |
śūnyaṃ kṛtvā tato dṛṣṭiṃ śūnyaṃ caiva tu lakṣayet || 11 ||

śūnyaṃ śūnyaṃ punaḥ śūnyaṃ triśūnyamucyate kṣaṇāt |
sarvaṃ śūnyaṃ nirābhāsa sāmarasyaṃ tadā bhavet || 12 ||

ghṛte ghṛtaṃ yathā kṣiptaṃ kṣīre kṣīraṃ tathaiva ca |
kevalatvaṃ yadā prāptaṃ na kiñcidapi cintayet || 13 ||

niskāmocchvāsikāṃstyaktvā pūrakaścāmṛtī bhavet |
kumbhakaṃ ca yadāproktaṃ yogināṃ yogadhāraṇāt || 14 ||

nivṛttiryatra jāyeta sarvaṃ śūnyaṃ pravartate |
śūnyamadhyagataṃ śūnyaṃ sthitaṃ vyomani vyomavat || 15 ||

<p. 87a> na raktaṃ na ca vā pītaṃ na śuklaṃ kṛṣṇameva ca |
sarvairguṇairvinirmuktaḥ sthānātītaṃ parāparam || 16 ||

pūrakaṃ ca tvayā proktaṃ kumbhakaṃ ca punaḥ punaḥ |
namāmi durlabhaṃ devaṃ kathaṃ jānanti mānavāḥ || 17 ||

vāyunā pūrakaṃ kṛtvā kumbhakaṃ kumbhavat punaḥ |
māyā hyeṣā kṛtā vatsa yena muhyanti jantavaḥ || 18 ||

kumbhakaṃ ca idaṃ kṛtvā hṛtsthānaṃ rūpavarjitam |
antaḥ śarīrasaṃsthaṃ tu na bāhyaṃ tu kadācana || 19 ||

sarvaṃ sa paramaṃ nāma pūrakaṃ cedamucyate |
tatrotpannaṃ yathākāśaṃ niścalasthānavarjitam || 20 ||

idaṃ śāntaṃ tathā putra brūhyenaṃ ca svatantrataḥ |
nandinā kriyate mudrā oṣṭhau tatra prapīḍitau || 21 ||

<p. 87b> śivaṃ dhyātvā munīndraistu na kiñcidapi cintayet |
santuṣṭohaṃ mahābhogirkathitaṃ te svatantrataḥ || 22 ||

mayātītaṃ paraṃ śāntaṃ vāgjāla parivarjitam |
madbhāvasandhimākhyātaṃ bhāvayecca punaḥ punaḥ || 23 ||

abhāve bhāvanā cātra mahārtha hitalocanaḥ |
na śaknomi mahābhoginyadi janmaśatairapi || 24 ||

bhāvayet paramānandaṃ yaḥ svaṃ vedasamuktitam |
anantaṃ śūnyamityuktaṃ hṛcchūnyaṃ rūpavarjitam || 25 ||

nāntaḥ śarīre saṃsthā tu na bāhye tu kadācana |
sarvaṃ samarasaṃ nāma niṣṭhāśūnyaṃ pravartate || 26 ||

pare śūnye pralīnāste svarūpaṃ naiva vidyate |
manobuddhirahaṅkāraṃ sthitaṃ mādvīkaśūlavat || 27 ||

<p. 88a> indriyāṇi tu śūnyāni pare śūnye layaṃ gatāḥ |
pare śūnye yadālīnaḥ svarūpaṃ naiva dṛśyate || 28 ||

tūryaiḥ paṭarunādaiśca janakolāhalaistathā |
yukti tattvasya niṣṇāto na manaḥ paricālyate || 29 ||

mayābandhaṃ kṛtaṃ vatsa sthānaṃ dhyānaṃ carācaram |
kevalasya kutaḥ sthānaṃ dhyānaṃ tasya na vidyate || 30 ||

dhāraṇādi na cāstīti sarvaśūnyaṃ ca nirguṇam |
nirguṇaṃ ca paraṃ bhittvā bhittvā caiva mayā kṛtam || 31 ||

svecchayā sa rasaṃ nāma atyucchinnaṃ samantataḥ |
dhanurdharo yathā śūra ākarṇaṃ pūrayeccharaḥ || 32 ||

lakṣyaṃ bhitvā tato lakṣyamevaṃ yogī satāhitaḥ |
na dhanurna ca vā kāṇḍaṃ lakṣyaṃ puruṣameva ca || 33 ||

evaṃ jñātvā paraṃ tattvaṃ sthitaṃ vyomani vyomavat |
<p. 88b> āpūryānyatamaṃ kāṇḍaṃ stambha dṛṣṭi vyavasthitam || 34 ||

idaṃ tattvaṃ yadā prāptaṃ na kiñcidapi cintayet |
na cittaṃ na ca vā buddhirna sthānaṃ varṇameva ca || 35 ||

na ca dhyānaṃ na vā dhyeyaṃ na granthirvāyumeva ca |
na granthaṃ na ca vā granthī na binduṃ nādameva ca || 36 ||

na lakṣyaṃ na ca vā lakṣī na śikhā turyameva ca |
tedau madhyaṃ yadā prāpta na kiñcidapi cintayet || 37 ||

na vāyuṃ na ca vā kāśaṃ na vahniṃ salilaṃ tathā |
na somaṃ na ca vā sūryaṃ na brahmā viṣṇureva ca || 38 ||

na rudraṃ na ca vā kālamīśvaraṃ śivameva ca |
anākhyaṃ ca nirābhāsaṃ nistattvaṃ ca nirāśrayam || 39 ||

channaṃ sarvagataṃ śāntaṃ sthitaṃ vyomeṣu vyomavat |
tadā pravartate kiñcit paśyamena punaḥ punaḥ || 40 ||

<p. 89a> tanmānaṃ ca punaḥ kṛtvā sthūlaṃ śūnye pralīyate |
sūkṣmaṃ śūnyaṃ yadā prāptaṃ pare śūnye pralīyate || 41 ||

tasmin sthāne śubhe prāpte niścale nirguṇe tathā |
tatraiva dhārayeccittaṃ yadanyostīti kāraṇam || 42 ||

eṣā sā paramākāṣṭhā paraṃ cittaṃ tathaiva ca |
eṣā sā paramā buddhiḥ parā cāpi pravartate || 43 ||

yoginastu tataḥ praśnaṃ patate nātrasaṃśayaḥ |
idaṃ viṣṇurvijānīyāt pāśaḥ krodhena cchidyate || 44 ||

mahatāṃ sarvadevānāṃ matvādevaśca kīrtitaḥ |
tārayecca prajāḥ sarvāstumburustena cocyate || 45 ||

īśvaratve tathāpīṣa īśvaratvaṃ prakīrtitam |
harate sarvapāpāni haro devaḥ prakīrtitaḥ || 46 ||

layanaṃ sarva jātīnāṃ layanālliṅgamucyate |
evaṃ sarvagataṃ devaṃ brahmarūpo na nirmalaḥ || 47 ||

krimikīṭapataṅgeṣu sthāvare jaṅgameṣu ca |
yatkiñcidvāṅmayaṃ sarvaṃ sṛṣṭidevaṃ pakīrtitam || 48 ||

tasya devātidevasya śaktirnādayate jagat |
evaṃ sarvagataṃ śūnyaṃ hṛdaye tatra lakṣayet || 49 ||

yadi sarvagataṃ deva śūnyaṃ brūhi kimucyate |
atha śūnyaṃ paraṃ brahmalakṣaṇaṃ grahaṇaṃ kutaḥ || 50 ||

bhagavandevadeveśa candrārdhakṛtaśekhara |
etat praśnaṃ paraṃ guhyaṃ prasādaṃ kuru śūlabhṛt || 51 ||

ṣaḍaṅgena tu yogena hṛdyaṃ śūnyaṃ tu grāhayet |
pūrṇaṃ nivartanaṃ tena pūrṇaṃ bhāvaṃ ca lakṣayet || 52 ||

pūrṇāhutiṃ tato dadyāddīkṣākāle samāśrite |
<p. 90a> bhāvitātmā sa yogena siddhiḥ khecaratāṃ vrajet || 53 ||

prāṇāyāmaṃ tathā dhyānaṃ pratyāhāraṃ ca dhāraṇā |
tarkaścaiva samādhiśca ṣaḍaṅgo yoga ucyate || 54 ||

etajjñāna mayaṃ proktaṃ jñeyaṃ śūnyaṃ prakīrtitam |
indriyāśca tataḥ śūnyaṃ cittaṃ śūnyaṃ tathaiva ca || 55 ||

buddhiśūnyaṃ vijānīyādātmaśūnyaṃ tataḥ punaḥ |
agniśūnyaṃ tataḥ kṛtvā dharmaśūnyaṃ ca niṣkalam || 56 ||

nirdhumaṃ ca paraṃ śūnyaṃ kumbhamadhye jalaṃ yathā |
himakāle tu saṃprāpte vivarṇaṃ niścalaṃ bhavet || 57 ||

evaṃ khaṃkāṣṭhadhūstadvatkhatiṣṭhe dviniyojayet |
idaṃ tatvaṃ yadāprāptaṃ paśyate(?) janma bandhanāt || 58 ||

<p. 90b> na pravarteta cādvaitaṃ gṛhasthasya kadācana |
indriyebhyo yataḥ saktaḥ saktomātsarya eva ca || 59 ||

avidyā grāhayedrāgamatarāgaṃ punaḥ punaḥ |
tasmānnivartate tatvaṃ cittaṃ yena na nirjitam || 60 ||

nirjitaṃ ca yadā cittaṃ tadā śreyaḥ pravartate |
śānto dānto jitakrodho bhikṣāśī vigata spṛhaḥ || 61 ||

idaṃ tu yogine dṛṣṭvā nandanīyaḥ prayatnataḥ |
darśanānmocayet pāpaṃ sparśanāddīkṣito bhavet || 62 ||

ālāpātgatra(?)saṃparkādbhojanācchayanāsanāt |
kulānaddharate skanda daśapūrvāndaśāparān || 63 ||

pakvaṃ caiva pratijñānaṃ ghaṭikā ca caturvidhām |
prathamaṃ dhūli bhedaṃ ca dvitīyaṃ hṛcchedabandhanam || 64 ||

<p. 91a> tṛtīyaṃ granthi bhedaṃ ca caturthaṃ paramucyate |
cittasambodhamātreṇa kathaṃ gṛhṇanti tatpadam || 65 ||

kena vā gṛhyate cittaṃ kasmin sthāne pralīyate |
devadeva mahādeva sarvastattvārthabhedaka || 66 ||

brūhi me paramaṃ jñānaṃ yena siddhyanti sādhakāḥ ||

khaṭikā procyate mokṣamuddharet granthi bhedataḥ |
khamiva paramaṃ jñātvā khaṭikeṣā prakīrtitā || 67 ||

cittaṃ citte tu saṅgṛhya buddhau buddhiṃ tathaiva ca |
sā tu buddhiḥ parājñeyā tatvamārgānu sāriṇī || 68 ||

śṛṇu śūnyasya vai lakṣyaṃ dharaṃ viśati tatkṣaṇāt |
praviṣṭe ca pare tatve samatvaṃ jāyate kṣaṇāt || 69 ||

<p. 91b> samatvaṃ ca yadā prāptaṃ parānandaṃ prajāyate |
parānandaṃ yadā prāptaṃ na kiñcidapi cintayet || 70 ||

praviśet tanmayo bhūtvā śivabījena sādhakaḥ |
tadā na śrūyate śabdaṃ śaṅkhabherī sa dundubhiḥ || 71 ||

tāḍitaṃ ca na bindeta tatastanmayatāṃ gataḥ |
etat te paramaṃ guhyaṃ paraṃ jñeyaṃ na saṃśayaḥ || 72 ||

idaṃ pratyayamāpannaṃ tatguruḥ pāśahā bhavet |
puṣpaṃ patraṃ phalaṃ toyaṃ yo dīkṣāṃ kurute naraḥ || 73 ||

navanābhaṃ tato yāgaṃ kṛtaṃ tena na saṃśayaḥ |
anyathā kurute dīkṣāṃ tatgururbrahmahā bhavet || 74 ||

bhāvanāyāstathā śaiva dvaitaṃ caivamaśeṣataḥ |
kliśyante te mahāmūḍhāḥ saṃsāre ca punaḥ punaḥ || 75 ||

dvaitaṃ caiva mahādvaitaṃ dvaitaikatvaṃ tathaiva ca |
<p. 92a> advaitaṃ na ca vā dvaitamatirme paramārthataḥ || 76 ||

vaṃśaṃ nāmamayājñātaṃ tvatprasādānmaheśvara |
mahārathaṃ kīdṛśaṃ ca jaṭā vai kīdṛśī bhavet || 77 ||

bhāsa(?)nāma kimutpannaṃ kiṃ vā khaṭvāṅgamucyate |
saṃkṣepādvadadeveśa yena mokṣaṃ dhruvaṃ bhavet || 78 ||

bhāvayeccāparaṃ śūnyamanantaṃ parivarjitam |
bhavacchedakaraṃ śāntaṃ paraṃ kasmataducyate || 79 ||

jaṭāvat snāpayeccittaṃ jaṭā hyetāḥ prakīrtitāḥ |
mahāsnānaṃ tadā proktaṃ mahāvrataṃ taducyate || 80 ||

nāsti tatparamānandaṃ cittakaṃ cittavarjitam |
tataḥ khakāṣṭavattiṣṭhet khaṭvāṅgaṃ tādṛśaṃ bhavet || 81 ||

<p. 92a> evaṃ gūḍhaṃ vijānīyāt guhavāsī tathocyate |
na nāma grahaṇān mukto na kāya tamanācchuciḥ || 82 ||

cittaṃ dhāmayate prājño mokṣa ityabhidhīyate |
vratasyā caraṇaṃ kṛtvā yogaṃ tatra samabhyaset || 84 ||

mayātīte paraṃbrahma lokatrayavivarjitam || 85 ||

vratena sahitā yogāḥ svayaṃ proktā maheśvara |
yogahīna vratāmuḍhā mudrā pañcaka bhūṣitāḥ || 86 ||

etanme saṃśayaṃ brūhi yena nissaṃśayo bhavet || 87 ||

vratena sahitā yogāḥ sarvaṃ siddhi pradāḥ śubhāḥ |
yogahīnavratāmūḍhā na mucyanti kadācana || 88 ||

vratasya caraṇaṃ kṛtvā lokayātrā vivarjitam |
<p. 93a> nispṛho nispṛhe nityaṃ samaloṣṭāśma kāñcanaḥ || 89 ||

śabdaṃ sparśaṃ rasaṃ rūpaṃ gandhaṃ caiva tu pañcamam |
etāmudrā mahatyaśca mucyate caturaṃ jagat || 90 ||

iti mukto vrajenmokṣaṃ yatra devo nirañjanaḥ ||

[i * śrī * rva * ddhā * ni * ṇa * go * raṃ * mā * m] ||

śivaṃ bhavatu ||


